"HELP_GAME_RULES" = "World Arena Flags is a fun game to learn world flags!\n\nRules:\n1. You see a country's flag\n2. Choose the correct name from the options\n3. Earn XP for correct answers\n4. Keep your daily streak\n5. Level up and climb leagues\n\nThe more you play, the more flags you learn!";
