"Система рейтингов и соревнований" = "Rating and competition system";
"HELP_LEAGUES_TEXT" = "Leagues are competitions with other players.\n\nLeagues (from lower to higher):\n• Bronze\n• Silver\n• Gold\n• Platinum\n• Diamond\n• Master\n\nWeekly updates:\n• Top 3 players get rewards\n• Players in 16–20 may be demoted\n• Others stay in the same league";

